# Vercel Ignore - Exclude from serverless function bundle

# Documentation (not needed in production)
*.md
!README.md

# Test files
**/__tests__/**
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx

# Development files
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.DS_Store

# Scripts not needed in production
scripts/fix-*.js
analyze-images.js
large-images-report.txt

# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup

# Image archives and source files (not needed in production)
image-library/
public/images/services-original/
